    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene Petelo ntūng'wa wa ng'wa Yesu Kilisito, kū basolwa abo bakwikalaga mu sī gītī bageni, basambaalile hose hose mu Ponto, Galatia, Kapadokia, Asia, na Bithinia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abo basolilwe kūfuma kale kūlenganīla na būmani bo ng'wa Mulungu Sīswe, gīkī beejiwe na Moyo; na babize bigwi kūlwa kūseeseebelwa mininga ga ng'wa Yesu Kilisito. Shigongo na mhola shibize hamò ning'we na shimukwīlīle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlūmba kūlwa kwīsagīlwa kwa Būpīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akumīlījiwe ū Mulungu, Ise wa ng'wa Seeba wise Yesu Kilisito; ūyo kūlwa shigongo shakwe shitaale watwingīgije mu kwisagīlwa kūpanga, ūtwīta kūbyalwa būpya mu nzīla ya būjūūko bo ng'wa Yesu Kilisito kūfuma mu bafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko watūtūūlile mu wingīji ūbo būtī bo kūkenaagūka, būtī bo kusosohala nūūlū kūkūlūhala. Ūbo būbīkilwe ng'wigūlū kūlwa nguno ying'we; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a bing'we abo mulang'hanilwe na nguzu ja ng'wa Mulungu mu nzīla ya kūzunya; gīkī mubize mo ū mu būpīji ūbo būlindīīlile koolechiwa, ūlū lyūshika ha būkalīkījo ī likanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mhayo gwenūyo mukūyegelaga mo, nūūlū īkī ū ng'wikanza ī liguhī īlī mukwītaga ng'waluha ūlū yaja chene, kūlwa nguno ya būgeng'wa bo mbika na mbika, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūbo būkūng'wizīīlaga kūlwa kūkūgema ū kūzunya kwing'we, ūko kūlī kwa mpango ntaale, kūtinda zahabu, ījo jikagemagwa bo kūbītiwa mu moto, jimanīke ū mpango gwajo, nūūlū īkī jilī ja kūkenaagūka. Na a bing'we mukūgemagwa ī haha, gīkī ūlū lyūshika ī likanza lya koolechiwa kwa ng'wa Yesu Kilisito, ū kūzunya kwing'we kwigengeleke gīkī kwigeleelilwe mu mhayo gw'ikūjo na kūkumīlīja na kūgongoola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno muntogilwe nūūlū īkī mutaalī ū kūmona, na munsanije nūūlū īkī mutūmonaga ī haha. Nīyo mukūyegaga na būyegi būtaale w'ikūjo īlo lītī na kasomboolele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī ng'halīlo ya kūzunya kwing'we īlī kūpījiwa kwa būpanga wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahangi bīkoobaga na kwīgīsīlīja ī mihayo ya būpīji wenūbū; būshihanga ī shigongo īsho shilabize ho kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalī batogilwe kūlitegeleja nī likanza, balīmane līkūbiza nanalī na lya mbika kī, īlo waboolekejaga ū Moyo wa ng'wa Kilisito ūyo walī mubo, aho akūbamanīkījaga ī mihayo ya būluhiwa bo ng'wa Kilisito, kūko ītaalī kūshika, nī ya makūjo ayo galabize ho a ha numa yaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakoolekejiwa gīkī baalī batitūmamīlaga boi benekīlī, alīyo batūmamaga kūlwa nguno ying'we. Basomboolaga mihayo īyo mukūwīlagwa ī haha na a babo bakūmulomeelaga Ng'hūlū Jawiza, mu nguzu ja ng'wa Moyo Ng'wela, ūyo wenhilwe kūfuma ng'wigūlū. Ī mihayo yenīyo na a bamalaika balī na ng'hūmbū ja kwībona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwikala mu nhūngwa ja wela",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ikalagi mumalīīlile ū mu maganiko ging'we, nīyo mubize balembeezu; mushiisagīlwe mu būshikanu ī shigongo īsho shikwenhwa kūlwa nguno ying'we ng'wikanza lya koolechiwa kwa ng'wa Yesu Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bizagi baana bigwi, yaya ū kūlondeela nhūngwa jing'we ja kale, ja kwikūmva; ūmo ng'washimīzīlaga aho ng'walī mutaalī kūmana mhayo gose gose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo īkī alī ng'wela ūyo wang'witana, ning'we bizagi beela ū mu nhūngwa jing'we jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gwandīkilwe gīkī, “Bizagi beela īkī ū nene nalī ng'wela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ūlū mukūng'witanaga Baba, ūyo akalamulaga būlī munhū gīt'ūmo shilī shītīle shakwe mu būtūsolanhya, shimīzagi na logohano ū ng'wikanza lya būgeni wing'we aho mutaalī mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno mumanile gīkī mutakomoolilwe mu nzīla ya shikolo sha kūkenaagūka, gītī, feza nūūlū zahabu, ū kwīnga ū mu nhūngwa jing'we ījo jitī na matwajo, ījo ng'walī ng'wanukūla kūfuma kū bakūlūgenji bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo mukomoolilwe mu nzīla ya mininga ga mpango ntaale, ga ng'wa Kilisito, ū Ng'wana wa Ng'holo ūyo atī na kabi nūūlū shilingo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo atūūlilwe ho kūfuma kale kūko sī ītaalī kūseeng'wa; nīyo ī haha ū mu shikū īji oolechiwe kūlwa nguno ying'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we ū mulī we munsanije Mulungu ūyo akanjūūcha kūfuma mu bafu; ūng'winha ikūjo, gīkī ū kwisagīlwa kwing'we kūbize kūnsendamīlile Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose īkī ū būpanga wing'we wamalile kwela kūlwa kwīzunya ī ng'hana, itogagwi mu būtogwa bo nyadūgū ūbo būtī na wibeeleja, itogagwi mu ng'hana kūfuma mu gatī ya ng'holò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nguno ng'wamalile kūbyalwa būpya, ītī kūfuma mu mbīyū ng'henagūku, alīyo īyo ītī na kūkenaagūka, mu nzīla ya mhayo mpanga go ng'wa Mulungu, ūyo gūlī gwa kūshinga ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pyī ī mibīlī īlī gītī maswa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
